    "description": "Corporate users report that a range of internal business apps under apps.meridian.example - billing, orders, reports and several others - cannot be reached from inside the company network: the pages fail to load / connections time out. Oddly, the exact same apps load fine for users and partners coming from outside the company. This started overnight and is still ongoing.\nSuspected cause: the billing-app v3 deployment that shipped last night (change CHG0041001) - please confirm whether that deploy broke it and get the internal users back online.\nInvestigate across the available systems, confirm the actual root cause before making changes, restore access for the internal users, and close this incident when the apps are reachable again.",
